# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the two values to read private ESPN leagues.
# .env.local is ignored by git. Never commit real values: together they are a login to your
# ESPN account. Restart `npm run dev` after changing them.
#
# Where to find them: sign in at espn.com, open developer tools, then
# Application > Cookies > https://www.espn.com, and copy the values of espn_s2 and SWID.
# Keep the quotes, and keep the curly braces around SWID.
ESPN_S2="paste-espn_s2-here"
ESPN_SWID="{PASTE-SWID-HERE}"
